right

M: circle "maker"

arrow from M.e right 200%
TQ: box invisible "..."
arrow
WS: box invisible "..."
arrow
RQ: box invisible "..."
arrow
C: circle "completer"

arrow from M.ne up right then right until even with TQ.w
T1: box "tasks" "#3" fit
arrow right until even with WS.w
W1: circle "worker"
arrow right until even with RQ.w
R1: box "results" "#workers" fit

arrow from M.se down right then right until even with TQ.w
T2: box "tasks" "#3" fit
arrow right until even with WS.w
W2: circle "worker"
arrow right until even with RQ.w
R2: box "results" "#workers" fit

arrow <- from C.nw up   left then to R1.e
arrow <- from C.sw down left then to R2.e

move from W2.s down 20%
O: box "pickup" "#workers" fit

arrow from M.s to (M.s, O.w) then to O.w
arrow from O.e to (C.s, O.e) then to C.s

move from T1.n up 20%
I: box "idle" "#workers" fit

arrow from W1.n up until even with I.e then to I.e
arrow from W2.nw to I.e chop

arrow from I.w left until even with M.n then to M.n
